### Command-line tools

Run the command, then sign in in the browser. No passport is needed.

<!-- connect: claude-code -->
- **Claude Code.** Run `claude mcp add --transport http margince {{.MCPURL}}`, then `/mcp`
  inside Claude Code. Guide: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp
<!-- connect: codex -->
- **Codex.** Run `codex mcp add margince --url {{.MCPURL}}`, then
  `codex mcp login margince`. Guide: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/extend/mcp?surface=cli
<!-- connect: antigravity -->
- **Antigravity.** Add `{ "mcpServers": { "margince": { "serverUrl": "{{.MCPURL}}" } } }` to
  `~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json`, then sign in from its agent settings. Guide:
  https://antigravity.google/docs/mcp
